        // that the new election rule does NOT flip a class whose volatile twin is equally
        // bindable. atmrep.Rep : RepMid<T> : RepBase<T> has the two template base levels of
        // atomic<int> : __atomic_base<int,true> : __atomic_base<int,false> and the same
        // volatile-twin overload pairs, but an IN-SCOPE header has every inline body emitted, so
        // BOTH twins keep a symbol here - measured, and the reason the libc++ state cannot be
